<title>SINGAPORE: Sincere Watch sees better 1997/98 profit.</title>
<headline>Sincere Watch sees better 1997/98 profit.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Watch retailer Sincere Watch Ltd said on Thursday it expected its profit to improve in the current year.</p>
<p>The company issued the statement with its 1996/97 annual results, which showed a 154 percent rise in net profit to Singapore $1.66 million.</p>
<p>It gave no details with the forecast.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
